<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan net currency reserves rise to $44.5 mln.</title>
<headline>Moldovan net currency reserves rise to $44.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moldova's net currency reserves rose sharply in January, National Bank of Moldova Chairman Leonid Talmaci said.</p>
<p> MOLDOVAN CURRENCY RESERVES Jan 1997    Dec 1997     Jan 1996</p>
<p>    gross reserves ($ mln)     313.7	 274.2	  256.8</p>
<p>    net reserves		    44.5	  23.5	   26.0</p>
<p>Talmaci said reserves provided three months' import cover and were sufficient to keep the Moldovan leu stable and service the $950 million foreign debt.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
